#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:2
msgid "How to manage maintainers for your project"
msgstr "如何管理项目的维护者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:4
msgid ""
"|org_brand| allows you to manage maintainers for your projects. Every "
"project is configured with its own list of maintainers who will all have "
"admin privileges to the project, so be careful when adding new maintainers."
msgstr "|org_brand| 允许你管理项目的维护者。每个项目都配置了自己的维护者列表，他们都将拥有该项目的管理员权限，因此添加新维护者时请务必谨慎。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:9
msgid ""
"When you add a maintainer to your project, they will be invited to join the "
"project as a maintainer. They will receive an email notification with a link"
" to accept the invitation, and won't have access to the project until they "
"accept the invitation."
msgstr "当你为项目添加维护者时，他们会收到加入项目担任维护者的邀请。他们会收到含接受邀请链接的邮件通知，在接受邀请前不会获得项目访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:15
msgid "Adding a maintainer"
msgstr "添加维护者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:17
msgid "Adding a maintainer gives them admin access to your project."
msgstr "添加维护者会赋予其项目的管理员访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:19
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:31
msgid "Follow these steps:"
msgstr "按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:21
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:33
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Maintainers`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Maintainers` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:22
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Add maintainer` button."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add maintainer` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:23
msgid "Fill out the form with the new maintainer's username or email address."
msgstr "在表单中填写新维护者的用户名或邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:24
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Invite` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:27
msgid "Removing a maintainer"
msgstr "移除维护者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:29
msgid "Removing a maintainer revokes their admin access to your project."
msgstr "移除维护者会撤销其项目的管理员访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:34
msgid "Find the maintainer you want to remove in the list."
msgstr "在列表中找到要移除的维护者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:35
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Remove` button next to their name."
msgstr "点击其名称旁的 :guilabel:`Remove` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:36
msgid "Confirm the removal in the dialog that appears."
msgstr "在弹出的对话框中确认移除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:40
msgid ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/managing-maintainers.rst:41
msgid "Learn how to manage teams within an organization on |com_brand|."
msgstr "了解如何在 |com_brand| 上管理组织内的团队。"

